        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(nomad): add delegated-run provider",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- Add the Nomad delegated-run provider with config, doctor, create/use/reuse/stop/cleanup lifecycle, archive sync, allocation exec, provider registration, docs, and live-smoke coverage.\n- Bind local claims to the exact Nomad address, region, namespace, job, allocation, and task; fail closed on lookup/auth/network errors and ownership drift.\n- Register jobs create-only, verify remote ownership again before destructive cleanup, confirm remote absence before removing claims, and preserve recovery state when cleanup is ambiguous.\n- Support both ACL-enabled and ACL-disabled clusters without persisting tokens or putting secret values on argv.\n- Add the user-facing changelog entry, with thanks to @coygeek.\n\nCloses https://github.com/openclaw/crabbox/issues/380.\n\n## Verification\n\nExact candidate: `4c6c316ff550900bd383f4037a585c36f0271b8c`\n\n- `go test -race ./...`\n- `go test -race ./internal/providers/nomad`\n- `go vet ./...`\n- `go run golang.org/x/tools/cmd/deadcode@v0.45.0 -test ./...`\n- `scripts/test-go-modules.sh`\n- `scripts/check-go-coverage.sh 90.0` (`90.0%`)\n- `node --test scripts/*.test.js` (`372/372`)\n- `node --test scripts/live-nomad-smoke.test.js` (`9/9`)\n- Worker format, lint, typecheck, Node typecheck, Vitest (`760/760`), Worker build, Dynamic Workers build, Node runtime build, and Docker pin check\n- command-doc, provider-matrix, docs-link, and docs-site checks\n- `go build -trimpath -o /tmp/crabbox ./cmd/crabbox`\n- focused controller timing test rerun `10/10` after one unrelated coverage-run timeout; isolated coverage retry passed\n- AutoReview clean on the final fixup and on the complete branch diff\n\n## Exact-head live proof\n\n- Built the exact candidate and ran it against disposable `hashicorp/nomad:2.0.3` at digest `sha256:05ea9dc0789c55c351d247763ad9b8078c79409e39ca0196c9761c03f467195d`.\n- Proved anonymous doctor on an ACL-disabled agent, create-only warmup, allocation readiness, archive sync, environment forwarding, retained reuse with deletion sync, no-sync execution, stop, and absence confirmation.\n- Lease: `cbx_de2b969baca3`; job: `crabbox-de2b969baca3`; allocation: `3c13fc52-2adc-43ea-bd4b-2b40852b72de`.\n- Final Nomad inventory: `0` Crabbox jobs and `0` allocations. Removed the exact disposable task container, agent container, temporary binary/config, and smoke state; final targeted residue count: `0`.\n- No credentials, external account, or paid resource used.\n",
